1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
«O'xsharmikin, o'xshamasmikin,
qilolarmikinman, qilolmasmikinman»

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Nima farqi bor?
Bari kelajakni bilolmaysiz.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Qo'lingizda bitta narsa bor xolos — harakat.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Faqatgina harakatni boshqarasiz.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,500
Oxirgi natija sizni qo'lingizda
bo'lmaydi hech qachon.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,500
Bizni ko'pchilik odam juda ham ajoyib o'ylaydi,
natijaga bog'lanib qolgan.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Tam, chiqib olib kimdir ringda
kaltak yese misol uchun,

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,500
«kaltak yedi, tuda-suda» e u
erkakga o'xshab quladi jangda.

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Qo'ldan kelganini qildi.

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,500
Gar men qo'limdan kelganini qilib turib,

11
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,500
nakoutga uchrab yuzim bilan
yerga yotib qolgan bo'lsam,

12
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,500
men o'zimdan g'ururlanardim.

13
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:39,000
Chunki oxirigacha bordim o'sha
maqsadim uchun va o'xshamadi.

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Masala nimada:

15
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Masala shundaki, faqatgina harakatni
siz boshqarasiz,

16
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,000
boshqa hech narsani boshqarolmaysiz.

17
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Ming harakat qilganingiz bilan boshqa
odamlarni fikrini ham boshqarolmaysiz,

18
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,500
taqdirni ham boshqarolmaysiz, kelajakka ham
hech qanaqasiga ta'sir qilolmaysiz po faktu.

19
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:59,000
Natija sizdan emas, barakat sizdan emas,
harakat sizdan.